{
  "res://art/audio/voices/ch1/ch1_s2_vegetable_vendor/卖菜大婶_start_seg01_dialog.mp3": {
    "file": "art/audio/voices/ch1/ch1_s2_vegetable_vendor/卖菜大婶_start_seg01_dialog.mp3",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": -15,
    "pitch": -31,
    "seconds": 10.488,
    "text": "最近村外不太平，我不敢进后山。少侠若要去密林，能否替我带一束叶缘泛红的止血草回来？",
    "sha256": "e7522d31a9fb65b1f6e5b3a883520557a5978a3887159a78dac7c7123fd8636d"
  },
  "res://art/audio/voices/ch1/ch1_s2_vegetable_vendor/卖菜大婶_accept_seg01_dialog.mp3": {
    "file": "art/audio/voices/ch1/ch1_s2_vegetable_vendor/卖菜大婶_accept_seg01_dialog.mp3",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": -12,
    "pitch": -31,
    "seconds": 6.432,
    "text": "它多长在背阴的石缝边。别为了采药惊动林里的猛兽",
    "sha256": "7aff67c495684695c4d6d70c63acf77bdbcd9f3a393e65ebd8867583058350dd"
  },
  "res://art/audio/voices/ch1/ch1_s2_vegetable_vendor_waiting/卖菜大婶_start_seg01_dialog.mp3": {
    "file": "art/audio/voices/ch1/ch1_s2_vegetable_vendor_waiting/卖菜大婶_start_seg01_dialog.mp3",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": -13,
    "pitch": -31,
    "seconds": 8.688,
    "text": "少侠，我托你找的止血草有消息了吗？叶缘泛红、长在背阴石缝旁的那种",
    "sha256": "e5ad25dc6054f600540584e91fb923dbddd31bc70a35890f37d22cf2ea6a69a3"
  },
  "res://art/audio/voices/ch1/ch1_s2_vegetable_vendor_turnin/卖菜大婶_start_seg01_dialog.mp3": {
    "file": "art/audio/voices/ch1/ch1_s2_vegetable_vendor_turnin/卖菜大婶_start_seg01_dialog.mp3",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": -8,
    "pitch": -31,
    "seconds": 6.84,
    "text": "正是这种止血草！这几日受伤的人多，有它就能多备几包伤药",
    "sha256": "b734af186ce371cf2afe0336b5468d0563f9d1bc74dc3d2f708cb3fd4f948d3d"
  },
  "res://art/audio/voices/ch1/ch1_s2_vegetable_vendor_done/卖菜大婶_start_seg01_dialog.mp3": {
    "file": "art/audio/voices/ch1/ch1_s2_vegetable_vendor_done/卖菜大婶_start_seg01_dialog.mp3",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": -13,
    "pitch": -31,
    "seconds": 6.288,
    "text": "多谢少侠。后山还有猛兽，采药也别离道路太远",
    "sha256": "e97694dce8aa943c83875dcb256b7f2a138cd3babbb10f4d2b712e14f4c4e7e1"
  },
  "res://art/audio/voices/ch1/ch1_s2_crying_woman/焦急妇人_start_seg01_dialog.mp3": {
    "file": "art/audio/voices/ch1/ch1_s2_crying_woman/焦急妇人_start_seg01_dialog.mp3",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
    "rate": -4,
    "pitch": -22,
    "seconds": 8.592,
    "text": "公子……公子救命！我夫君三天前被一伙黑衣人掳走，到现在没回来——他们往城西去了",
    "sha256": "dc4b508b46eea2ef7a29a479434913252d60fd04eeb48f2329dd77796a87c852"
  },
  "res://art/audio/voices/ch1/ch1_s2_crying_woman_waiting/焦急妇人_start_seg01_dialog.mp3": {
    "file": "art/audio/voices/ch1/ch1_s2_crying_woman_waiting/焦急妇人_start_seg01_dialog.mp3",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
    "rate": -11,
    "pitch": -22,
    "seconds": 7.272,
    "text": "公子，我夫君有消息了吗？他被带去城西以后，我一夜都没合眼",
    "sha256": "7d17448a13aa2ab80aff1d5b15c87b0ffcbfdbe4f4561196b5105e449c86b993"
  },
  "res://art/audio/voices/ch1/ch1_s2_crying_woman_turnin/焦急妇人_start_seg01_dialog.mp3": {
    "file": "art/audio/voices/ch1/ch1_s2_crying_woman_turnin/焦急妇人_start_seg01_dialog.mp3",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
    "rate": -6,
    "pitch": -22,
    "seconds": 7.656,
    "text": "他总算平安了。多谢你把他救出来。这些银两和伤药你拿着，路上保重",
    "sha256": "25dbd83589ef644607ca69a4b403ed18f5c5b7fe64bacc25995b2096c9faa699"
  },
  "res://art/audio/voices/ch1/ch1_s2_crying_woman_done/焦急妇人_start_seg01_dialog.mp3": {
    "file": "art/audio/voices/ch1/ch1_s2_crying_woman_done/焦急妇人_start_seg01_dialog.mp3",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
    "rate": -9,
    "pitch": -22,
    "seconds": 5.64,
    "text": "他正在家养伤。等他能下地了，我们再来当面道谢",
    "sha256": "dac38b82d48d7e2968c7727fc0a3f057f4cd0f2f202a84b96cdec6f57350f272"
  }
}
